Scope of this repository.

This repository contains a verifier for the hpx/1 evidence record format, the
normative specification for that format, and a set of synthetic conformance
vectors.

It does not contain, and no licence here extends to, the evidence capture
adapters, the record production and signing implementation, or any other
component of the MedXT evidence layer. Those are separate works, are not
published, and remain proprietary to MedXT Holdings Corp.

---

The conformance vectors in conformance/ are synthetic. They contain no real
beneficiary, provider, encounter or claim. Identifiers appearing in them are
invented and are not assigned to any person or organisation.

